---
// Cross-section of a camera-based tactile sensor.
---
<svg class="fig" viewBox="0 0 680 270" role="img" aria-labelledby="to-title to-desc">
  <title id="to-title">Cross-section of a camera-based tactile sensor</title>
  <desc id="to-desc">A soft clear gel is covered by a thin opaque reflective skin. Lights at the sides illuminate the skin from inside, and a camera underneath looks up at it. An object pressing into the gel deforms the skin, and the camera sees the shape of the contact as a change in shading.</desc>
  <rect class="box" x="120" y="150" width="340" height="86" rx="8" />
  <path class="soft1 c1" stroke-width="1.4" d="M130 150 V96 H246 Q262 96 268 112 Q290 134 312 112 Q318 96 334 96 H450 V150 Z" />
  <path class="c3" fill="none" stroke-width="4" d="M130 96 H246 Q262 96 268 112 Q290 134 312 112 Q318 96 334 96 H450" />
  <circle class="ink-fill" cx="290" cy="82" r="34" opacity="0.5" /><text x="290" y="40" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small">object pressing in</text>
  <rect class="ink-fill" x="264" y="196" width="52" height="30" rx="4" /><path class="wire-muted dash" d="M290 196 L160 100 M290 196 L420 100" />
  <text x="290" y="250" text-anchor="middle" class="t-small t-strong">camera</text>
  <rect class="f2" x="134" y="156" width="26" height="12" rx="2" /><rect class="f4" x="420" y="156" width="26" height="12" rx="2" />
  <text x="112" y="166" text-anchor="end" class="t-small">LED</text><text x="468" y="166" class="t-small">LED</text>
  <line class="link" x1="398" y1="124" x2="490" y2="110" /><text x="496" y="106" class="t-small t-strong t-c1">clear soft gel</text><text x="496" y="122" class="t-small">deforms under contact</text>
  <line class="link" x1="434" y1="94" x2="490" y2="60" /><text x="496" y="52" class="t-small t-strong t-c3">reflective skin</text><text x="496" y="68" class="t-small">blocks outside light</text>
  <text x="496" y="190" class="t-small">The camera sees the skin's</text><text x="496" y="205" class="t-small">shape from inside: fine texture,</text><text x="496" y="220" class="t-small">contact area and, from how</text><text x="496" y="235" class="t-small">markers shift, shear force.</text>
</svg>
